 "notes": "A flat, print-only form on page 16 of the same packet as NJ-REG: answers are printed on its lines. entity_type prints the code before the dash (DLC for a New Jersey LLC). Directors and incorporators (corporations only; an LLC answers None) are one per line, 'name, street, city, ST ZIP', split into the form's columns. The signers are 'name, title'; their signatures and dates are left for them. Stock (item 4) and duration (item 5) are left blank as the form says for an LLC; a corporation's authorized shares, the item 11 entity-specific statements on page 17 and any attached articles are left for the applicant. The fee goes with the filing.",
